  "_comment": [
    "Regression fixture: united.com flight search, reconstructed from a real",
    "Copy4Chat paste whose boxed output came back with torn borders, a frame",
    "wrapped onto a second line, and a URL breaking out of its cell.",
    "",
    "All three traced to one defect: the renderer returned bare string arrays",
    "of unknown width and wrapped them *after* composition, so a nested box's",
    "border could be word-wrapped. Hence the Rect invariant.",
    "",
    "The long aria-label, the long URLs and the deep nesting are all load",
    "bearing here. Do not tidy them."
  ],
